# Retrieving Images Verbally: No More Key Words and Other Heresies.

**Authors:** Small, Jocelyn Penny

## Abstract
Describes the development of a system to retrieve images for an international project that is producing a pictorial dictionary of classical mythology, the Lexicon Iconographicum Mythologiae Classicae. Applications to other types of information are discussed, two classification systems for Art History are described, and design principles for databases are suggested. (three references) (LRW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ428920

